---
title: How to add document into a deal
sidebar:
  order: 9
---
Follow these steps to attach a document to a deal in **Taskip’s Sales Pipeline**:

#### **Step 1: Navigate to Sales Pipeline**

1. On the **Taskip Dashboard,** click on **Sales Pipeline** from the left sidebar.

![](image-3-1024x472.png)

#### **Step 2: Open the Edit Deal Modal**

1. Locate the deal to which you want to add a document.
1. Click on the **three-dot menu (⋮)** on the deal card.
1. Select **Edit** from the dropdown.

#### **Step 3: Attach Documents**

1. Scroll down to the **Select Documents** field in the Edit Deal modal.
1. Click inside the **Select Documents** field.
1. Choose from the available documents or add a new one.
1. Once selected, the document will appear as a tag in the field.

![](image-4.png)

#### **Step 4: Save the Changes**

1. Review your changes.
1. Click the **Save** or **Update** button to confirm.

Your selected document is now successfully attached to the deal.
